<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LA Retail lifts yr headline shr.</title>
<headline>LA Retail lifts yr headline shr.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31, 1996 vs year to December 31, 1995</p>
<p>		    (millions of rands unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr (cts)	 183   vs   507 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		  1,456   vs   507 loss</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    9.61    vs   3.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    9.62    vs   3.17 loss</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    0.09    vs   1.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		   9.02    vs   33.09</p>
<p>Full name: LA Retail Stores Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said that the results only reflected two months of trading by LA Retail Stores following the reverse listing into the Ensign cash shell and the change of the company's year end from December 31 to August 31. They were therefore not comparable.</p>
<p>It said the listing had been well received by the market and it was well positioned to grow its core business and achieve earnings as outlined in the prospectus.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
